From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DeepSeek Harness <noreply@deepseek.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 13:44:11 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(app): add Rime sync storage permission and config file
 manager

- request MANAGE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE so librime can write sync_dir in
  shared storage (for example Download/Rime-Sync) on Android 11+
- add a built-in file manager and UTF-8 editor for Rime/Fcitx5 configs
- clean up a stale .temp.userdb before Fcitx starts
- fix plugin discovery for debug builds and preserve the manifest queries
- add a debug-only broadcast hook for sync/shared-storage testing
