+<resources>
+    <string name="storage_permission_title">Storage access for Rime sync</string>
+    <string name="storage_permission_message">Rime writes its synced dictionaries and configuration backup directly to the directory set by sync_dir in installation.yaml (for example Download/Rime-Sync). Android 11 and later block such writes unless Fcitx5 is granted “All files access”.\n\nThe same permission also lets the built-in file manager edit configuration files in shared storage.</string>
